{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/d76ccf77bbd3d6efbb792aba2279e466.poster.avif?t=1772165477\" width=618 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/d76ccf77bbd3d6efbb792aba2279e466.webm?t=1772165477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/d76ccf77bbd3d6efbb792aba2279e466.mp4?t=1772165477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bootsies</strong> is a <strong>pure 1D fighting game</strong> with a handmade retro aesthetic that <strong>emphasizes reading your opponent, precise spacing, and making bold moves to outplay opponents</strong>. Play as a colorful cast of cute boot-clad fighters determined to shape their planet's future. Steel-toe yourself and BOOT UP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/8424850bb17eec424d83f428426d8e42.apng?t=1772165477\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/8424850bb17eec424d83f428426d8e42.poster.avif?t=1772165477\" class=\"bb_img\" width=200 height=200 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/0ec8205f1065c205b107e399869f5e7c.apng?t=1772165477\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/0ec8205f1065c205b107e399869f5e7c.poster.avif?t=1772165477\" class=\"bb_img\" width=200 height=200 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/504e6ceb941e02ac9150b7c983ae9412.apng?t=1772165477\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/504e6ceb941e02ac9150b7c983ae9412.poster.avif?t=1772165477\" class=\"bb_img\" width=200 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/0159611e341be5910acb5d92cd55744c.avif?t=1772165477\" width=618 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bootsies is designed so that anyone can pick it up and start outplaying any opponent within minutes, but experienced players versed in fundamentals will stay endlessly engaged in intense battles rich with layers of spacing, reads, and adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bootsies uses an intuitive button scheme with no directional inputs! That means you can even play this game one-handed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core of the gameplay is built around the <strong>neutral triangle</strong> structure common to all fighting games. Bootsies hones in on this tense dance of rock-paper-scissors at its very heart, and takes it to new depths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/ca4b83ba21848466a4bbf25e98b33570.avif?t=1772165477\" width=618 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To beat your opponent in Bootsies, you have to push them off the platform. There are no health bars, no damage percentages. You live and die by enforcing threats with your trusty boot and buster, knowing when to push or to pull back, and preventing your opponent from reading your rhythm. Manage your resources and keep your opponent on their toes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/bf067e640accaeaa180c6f1e4d5fcadf.avif?t=1772165477\" width=618 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bootsies comes complete with rollback netcode and configurable input delay. The de facto standard for modern fighting games, Bootsies allows for crisp, responsive online play. Enjoy throwing down with friends and rivals from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/fbee7f16fd8505d87b4e8dd7f25dfa45.avif?t=1772165477\" width=618 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a world-ending threat appears, John Bootsies steps forward to hold the Grand Bootsies Tournament to find the most capable warrior in the world. You will rise up the league rankings as you compete in ranking tournaments, growing yourself from local legend to national champion. Decide how to spend your free time before tournaments between training and spending time with friends to give yourself the best chance at reaching the top without burning out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/d8ee6ba2b28f8c8f368bd6a32bcc92d2.avif?t=1772165477\" width=618 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete various in-game goals to earn in-game currency to unlock various cosmetics, art and music! Have an enjoyable completionist experience supplemented by detailed checklists as you work towards 100%. Speedrun timers for singleplayer modes and other challenges help you focus on the fight as you go for faster and faster times! From the opening moments of the game to the credits, get down to some infectious tunes reminiscent of simpler times! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3421590?t=1772165477","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3421590?t=1772165477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/c0ff5dabb861e94277c735684c08e5b10d1aeb68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772165477","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/c0ff5dabb861e94277c735684c08e5b10d1aeb68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772165477","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4062850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/d76ccf77bbd3d6efbb792aba2279e466.poster.avif?t=1772165477\" width=618 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/d76ccf77bbd3d6efbb792aba2279e466.webm?t=1772165477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/d76ccf77bbd3d6efbb792aba2279e466.mp4?t=1772165477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bootsies</strong> is a <strong>pure 1D fighting game</strong> with a handmade retro aesthetic that <strong>emphasizes reading your opponent, precise spacing, and making bold moves to outplay opponents</strong>. Play as a colorful cast of cute boot-clad fighters determined to shape their planet's future. Steel-toe yourself and BOOT UP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/8424850bb17eec424d83f428426d8e42.apng?t=1772165477\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/8424850bb17eec424d83f428426d8e42.poster.avif?t=1772165477\" class=\"bb_img\" width=200 height=200 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/0ec8205f1065c205b107e399869f5e7c.apng?t=1772165477\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/0ec8205f1065c205b107e399869f5e7c.poster.avif?t=1772165477\" class=\"bb_img\" width=200 height=200 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/504e6ceb941e02ac9150b7c983ae9412.apng?t=1772165477\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/504e6ceb941e02ac9150b7c983ae9412.poster.avif?t=1772165477\" class=\"bb_img\" width=200 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/0159611e341be5910acb5d92cd55744c.avif?t=1772165477\" width=618 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bootsies is designed so that anyone can pick it up and start outplaying any opponent within minutes, but experienced players versed in fundamentals will stay endlessly engaged in intense battles rich with layers of spacing, reads, and adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bootsies uses an intuitive button scheme with no directional inputs! That means you can even play this game one-handed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core of the gameplay is built around the <strong>neutral triangle</strong> structure common to all fighting games. Bootsies hones in on this tense dance of rock-paper-scissors at its very heart, and takes it to new depths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/ca4b83ba21848466a4bbf25e98b33570.avif?t=1772165477\" width=618 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To beat your opponent in Bootsies, you have to push them off the platform. There are no health bars, no damage percentages. You live and die by enforcing threats with your trusty boot and buster, knowing when to push or to pull back, and preventing your opponent from reading your rhythm. Manage your resources and keep your opponent on their toes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/bf067e640accaeaa180c6f1e4d5fcadf.avif?t=1772165477\" width=618 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bootsies comes complete with rollback netcode and configurable input delay. The de facto standard for modern fighting games, Bootsies allows for crisp, responsive online play. Enjoy throwing down with friends and rivals from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/fbee7f16fd8505d87b4e8dd7f25dfa45.avif?t=1772165477\" width=618 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a world-ending threat appears, John Bootsies steps forward to hold the Grand Bootsies Tournament to find the most capable warrior in the world. You will rise up the league rankings as you compete in ranking tournaments, growing yourself from local legend to national champion. Decide how to spend your free time before tournaments between training and spending time with friends to give yourself the best chance at reaching the top without burning out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/extras/d8ee6ba2b28f8c8f368bd6a32bcc92d2.avif?t=1772165477\" width=618 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete various in-game goals to earn in-game currency to unlock various cosmetics, art and music! Have an enjoyable completionist experience supplemented by detailed checklists as you work towards 100%. Speedrun timers for singleplayer modes and other challenges help you focus on the fight as you go for faster and faster times! From the opening moments of the game to the credits, get down to some infectious tunes reminiscent of simpler times! </p>","developers":["Playgarden Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421590/048af111fc381153c2d46f050c02cb1e74400a7c/header.jpg?t=1772165477","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3421590/845451/7200b715ea5a827dc855fa79f4f1a11a149b1eaf/1750849333/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741815667","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3421590/845451/7200b715ea5a827dc855fa79f4f1a11a149b1eaf/1750849333/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741815667","highlight":true,"hls_h264"